It's important to note that you need to use regex functions in the assertion to check the pattern of the assertion message, such as using "Regex.IsMatch" to check if the message includes certain words such as "the template file exists", "the template Handler has been initialized with the fileName", and "we have retrieved the Templates correctly from the TemplateHandler".
